<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks up to 60,566.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks up to 60,566.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Sept 16 totaled 60,566 bales, up slightly from 60,054 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 602 bales issued, 2,036 decertification orders, 90 cancellations, and no bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk 212-859-1640</p>
